H3 -- audience effect after 30 min of rearing, 8 seeds, 16 hens

audience effect = calling with flockmates in earshot minus calling alone
a real cockerel shows a large positive effect; a hatchling should show ~0

condition          when      alarm alone  alarm aud.   effect  food alone  food aud.   effect
---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
audible kin        hatch           0.320       0.323   +0.003       0.363      0.362   -0.001
audible kin        reared          0.318       0.320   +0.001       0.365      0.365   +0.000
flat kin (E005)    hatch           0.320       0.323   +0.003       0.363      0.362   -0.001
flat kin (E005)    reared          0.319       0.321   +0.002       0.362      0.360   -0.002
fixed (control)    hatch           0.320       0.323   +0.003       0.363      0.362   -0.001
fixed (control)    reared          0.320       0.323   +0.003       0.363      0.362   -0.001

comprehension -- does hearing an alarm call make her crouch, with no
predator to see? the audience effect cannot emerge without this, since
a call that nobody responds to can never repay its cost.

condition               hatch     reared     change
--------------------------------------------------
audible kin           -0.0001    -0.0001    -0.0001
