audible kin        alarm effect change over rearing -0.002 +/- 0.001 SE   suggestive (t=1.22, need 2.37)
audible kin        food  effect change over rearing +0.001 +/- 0.009 SE   noise (t=0.13)
flat kin (E005)    alarm effect change over rearing -0.001 +/- 0.001 SE   noise (t=0.97)
flat kin (E005)    food  effect change over rearing -0.001 +/- 0.007 SE   noise (t=0.22)
fixed (control)    alarm effect change over rearing +0.000 +/- 0.000 SE   noise (t=0.00)
fixed (control)    food  effect change over rearing +0.000 +/- 0.000 SE   noise (t=0.00)

positive = the hen learned to call more when someone is listening
the fixed control must show ~0; if it moves, the assay is measuring something other than learning
